== Trivia ==
*Paying '''Bruuh''' the {{C|1m}} unlocks the "Scam?" [[achievement]].
*'''Bruuh''' as a [[Garden Visitor]], is the only visitor to only appear {{Green|1 time}}, unless invited again using {{Item|Bachelor's Rose}}.

